  <item>
    <title>vol.4 畅聊《好东西》｜坐稳了，我们将驶向一个狂袭的宇宙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6746e7a111045e78e55f5032</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6746e7a111045e78e55f5032</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 11:49:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，我本年度最期待的电影《好东西》终于上映啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切都是那么轻盈而舒适，像女性世界的乌托邦，我们可以做不完美的大女人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那什么是好东西呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，就让我们一起来聊聊关于这部电影的一切，聊聊Her story。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>ps：在本期节目评论区留言，我们将抽取1位订阅者送上《快乐上等》新书一本，欢迎互动！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQjjak4zBcTQxQEvOpjk6tZ_efu.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕙【Shownotes】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">1:29</a> 放声大笑，与电影外面的世界</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 第一次认识邵艺辉：《北电毕业的人在干什么》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">6:17</a> 没有不一样的话想说，拍电影就等于浪费资源</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">6:44</a>王铁梅：母职困境，声音蒙太奇和“看不见的劳动”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">8:26</a>不要磕头，不要父权，要打回去</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">9:34</a> 这个世界还需要真相吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a>小叶：原生家庭困境，和小叶互为镜像的我们</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a>小孩：自我困境（性别困境），小孩为什么叫小孩？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 月经，就该拿上桌来说</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> 学校杀死艺术，我要在规则外打鼓</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a>雄竞的男人真的冒犯了男观众吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> “还是要给年轻人机会”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">25:51</a> 普通的，也不许被擅自撕碎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 是可爱的前夫，是金句制造机，是伪女权的男人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 讨论时刻：真的有“女权的男人”吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a>这边是《上海精英海王使用手册》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> 孙红雷：好东西首映，可惜来了个老东西</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 聊聊更多有趣的情节：尾随、举报、去痛药，抽烟、幻想、陈凯歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> 电影小彩蛋：歌单、书单、海报cos、小惊喜</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> 我们的生活会变好吗？会，我们会建立一个新的游戏</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵【电影歌单】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《蜜湖》——简约情人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《滥俗的歌》——汉堡黄</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《明天会更好》——罗大佑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《小孩儿》——靴腿乐队</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《八九点钟的太阳》——熊熊作业</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《Send My Heart With A Kiss》 ——Stephen Sanchez</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《Les Mouchoirs Blancs 》——Berry（本期中间段落）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《The Story》——Brandi Carlile</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《Life is》——Jessica Pratt</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《Leaning On the Everlasting Arms》——曹芙嘉，文昭宁</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《她不再幻想》——陈婧霏（本期片尾）</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚【电影部分书单】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《父权制与资本主义》——上野千鹤子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《看不见的女性》——卡罗琳·克里亚多·佩雷斯</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《她们不是唠叨，只是受够了》——杰玛·哈特莉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《快乐上等》——上野千鹤子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《性别麻烦》——朱迪斯·巴特勒</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《我的妈妈是精灵》——陈丹燕</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《疼痛部》——杜布拉夫卡·乌格雷西奇</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️【主播】圆圆</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌳欢迎加入听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp8XKz_hBQFXtknZuHVpWzqM5arg.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系方式：zukipd@aka.yeah.net【请备注来意】</span></p>]]></description>
