  <item>
    <title>vol.3 【小圆桌】对话西班牙留学生：20万，我怎么也花不完</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66473dda82b428eafd48ffcc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66473dda82b428eafd48ffcc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 May 2024 11:22:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们，我回来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们开启了一个新的小版块——“小圆桌系列”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在“小圆桌”上，我们会邀请到朋友、各界人士、甚至是陌生人，一起侃侃大山，聊聊小天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么首先上桌的是——当当当！我身边的留学生们！你将听到：各国八卦故事、乡愁综合症、某国人进化论、留子小破事儿等等！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>👨【本期上桌嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张御翰，98年硬汉，山东济南人，留学经历：西班牙-巴塞罗那大学-综合生理学-研</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内工作经历：上海—济南，目前有转行打算</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容由浅到深，渐入佳境，更有惊喜留在最后！欢迎收听，友好交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 自我介绍：大家好，他是张御翰</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 为什么去西班牙：好国家很多，但……</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 在西班牙，一年20万能干嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 留学日常与“姓李”的外国朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>5.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="469">07:49</a> 我给留学生活打9.9分</span></p><span></span><p><span>6.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 什么？差点被当成easy girl？</span></p><span></span><p><span>7.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> 为什么推荐去西班牙留学</span></p><span></span><p><span>8.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 欧洲留学生其实是游学生</span></p><span></span><p><span>9.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 一期一会，旅行中遇到的你们</span></p><span></span><p><span>10.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> “我差点和一个日本人打起来”</span></p><span></span><p><span>11.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 中外师生关系差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>12.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> 更推荐长大后再留学</span></p><span></span><p><span>13.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a> 西班牙读书“卷不卷”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>14.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> 游子啊游子，我想我还是回家好</span></p><span></span><p><span>17.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> 不同的“上海”又怎样，人生体验至上</span></p><span></span><p><span>18.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> &nbsp;亲人，我们一生还能团聚多少次</span></p><span></span><p><span>19.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a> 色彩心理学小尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span>20.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 脱离轨道，骑自行车去看看旷野</span></p><span></span><p><span>21.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a> 我想对此刻说…</span></p><span></span><p><span>22.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 小广告</span></p><span></span><p><span>23.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2613">43:33</a> 留给大家的惊喜，一定听完</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️【主播】圆圆</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵【耳机里】</span></p><span></span><p><span>·《Too Sad To Cry》</span></p><span></span><p><span>·《When You Were Mine》</span></p><span></span><p><span>·《Before You Go》</span></p><span></span><p><span>·《Flying》</span></p><span></span><p><span>·《人生是旷野》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌳【加入听友群】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQMLCWXlvuGfohAwPy_yb_RHxnU.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgxS-d6mo4WBRnzF4_zaykmFfGcC.m4a" length="45909478" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmc7l2C1h0W4rVs4J1qLXY9OOnHn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.2 吃上《花儿与少年》这碗饭后，我的精神乌托邦开始搭建</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ef19472d96b6aa8017bcc3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ef19472d96b6aa8017bcc3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Mar 2024 14:46:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们，好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小满万全》的第二期终于穿过一个大P人的层层拖延，来到了咱面前（在此忏悔）</span></p><span></span><p><span>我看《花儿与少年》的跨度蛮大的，第一期看完，再开启已经是年后，狂刷14期，大呼：“这碗饭，好吃！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容治愈度超标，内容由浅到深，欢迎收听，友好交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙</span><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>终于吃上饭了！我的精神乌托邦开始搭建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">2:29</a>内耗更外耗的固执老王哥啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a>其实我挺想让自己变 I 一点的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">7:51</a>体验永远大过于完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">8:32</a>聊聊自洽：人生不是要交100分答卷的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a>提一嘴小胡，一个击中过我的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a>入深：那些记忆深刻的瞬间！都是好好的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>冰岛封神：从我们相遇，到一起看星星</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>爆哭：妈妈，我想像花瓣一样一分为二</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a>嚯，这氛围感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1497">24:57</a>聊聊友谊：活跃、休眠、纪念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a>向我所有的朋友们说一声：生活顺利，要幸福！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>主播：圆圆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span><strong><span>耳机里：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《You There》Aquilo</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Angel》Cathartic Fall</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Through Your Eyes》Jordan Critz</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Midnight Pilots》Anthony Lazaro</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Burn It Down》Billy Lockett</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《24/7, 365》elijah woods</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Things You Said》Cody Fry, Abby Cates</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《The Middle》Dream Tunes</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Flying》Cody Fry</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《When You Were Mine》Hayd</span></li><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llaM1zm7qZC824c5A54n5Fe0MScC.m4a" length="28438320" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtYzdsMkMxaDBXNHJWczRKMXFMWFk5T09uSG4ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.1 贾玲：希望我们都可以“看心情”｜热辣滚烫，好深的心机！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d9ff870bef6c2074478758</link>
